{"meta":{"id":"tt32642156","type":"movie","name":"El hombre menguante","imdb_id":"tt32642156","description":"La historia de un hombre común y corriente que divide su vida entre su empresa de construcción naval y su familia. Ante un extraño e inexplicable fenómeno meteorológico durante un viaje por mar, comienza a menguar inexorablemente, sin que la ciencia pueda explicarlo. Atrapado repentinamente en su propio sótano y midiendo apenas unos centímetros de altura, debe luchar por sobrevivir en este entorno cotidiano que se ha vuelto hostil. Adaptación de la novela 'El hombre menguante' (The Shrinking Man) de Richard Matheson.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt32642156.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pgvn1tazqI9mZaRCNQUqNr3umvG.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h2WSZhZb6LlXAHdOUZ2liOjl4n1.png","genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-10-22T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"99 min","imdbRating":"5.8","country":"France, Belgium","cast":["Jean Dujardin","Marie-Josée Croze","Daphné Richard","Serge Swysen","Salim Talbi","Miranda Raison","Stéphanie Van Vyve"],"director":["Jan Kounen"],"writer":["Richard Matheson","Jan Kounen","Christophe Deslandes"],"trailers":[{"source":"wsGd-nDCE-s","type":"Trailer","name":"EL HOMBRE MENGUANTE Tráiler Español (2025) Ciencia ficción","ytId":"wsGd-nDCE-s","lang":"es"},{"source":"dX1E-9jE4bs","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"dX1E-9jE4bs","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"wsGd-nDCE-s","title":"EL HOMBRE MENGUANTE Tráiler Español (2025) Ciencia ficción"},{"ytId":"dX1E-9jE4bs","title":"Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"5.8","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt32642156"},{"name":"Aventura","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Aventura"},{"name":"Ciencia ficción","category":"Genres","url"